    "content": "energy self sufficiency was Energy to GDP \nElasticity, the ratio of the country s domestic energy supply to total supply measures the d was The  percentage  change  in  energy  supply  to \nachieve one percent change in national GDP. \nCalculated as the ratio of growth of primary \nenergy demand over GDP growth..",
