  {
    "content": "energy self sufficiency was Gas\n(or Natural Gas), the ratio of the country s domestic energy supply to total supply measures the d was A naturally occurring mixture of hydrocarbon \nand \nnon-hydrocarbon \ngases \nin \nporous \nformations beneath the earth's surface, often \nin  association  with  petroleum.  The  principal \nconstituent is methane..",
    "metadata": {
      "source": "final_11_20_25_doe_key_energy_stat_pocket_size_2024_table_066_p54.csv",
