  {
    "content": "energy self sufficiency was Gross Domestic \nProduct (GDP), the ratio of the country s domestic energy supply to total supply measures the d was Total  market  value  of  all  final  goods  and \nservices  produced  within  the  country \nin  a \ngiven period of time (usually a calendar year), \nor the sum of value added of all final goods \nand  services  produced  within  a  country  in  a \ngiven period of time..",
